{
  "summary": "Nick Xenophon Team senator Skye Kakoschke-Moore has announced she will leave the Senate after discovering she holds British citizenship through her mother. She said she had long believed she was not eligible, but recent advice confirmed she was a citizen by descent. Kakoschke-Moore plans to seek a high court ruling on how her vacancy should be handled and hopes to return to the Senate. Nick Xenophon said the party was deeply upset by her departure and suggested the legal situation remains uncertain."
}

